Club receptionist: Good afternoon! How can I help you?
You: Hello! {{1}}
Club receptionist: Of course. We have football, basketball, swimming and tennis.
You: I love swimming. {{2}}?
Club receptionist: Classes are on Tuesdays and Thursdays at six in the evening.
You: That’s perfect for me. And {{3}}?
Club receptionist: It’s twenty-five euros a month for students.
You: {{4}}
Club receptionist: Yes, you only need to fill in this form and bring a photo.
You: I forgot to bring a photo today. {{5}}
Club receptionist: No problem. You can bring it next week, but please don’t forget it.
You: {{6}}
